// data/reference/weapons/commonwealth.ron
//
// Commonwealth Tank & Gun Characteristics Chart (rules §4.47) — DATA.
// Human-readable companion: docs/source-materials/tank-gun-characteristics-commonwealth.md
//
// Map keyed by weapon-system name -> WeaponsSystem. Absent rating = "-"/not-applicable.
// `kind` is the weapon category (Tank/Artillery/AntiTank/LightAntiAir/HeavyAntiAir/
// Reconnaissance), used for combined arms (§15.4) and barrage class (§12.6).
// breakdown_adjustment (BAR): positive = Right shift, negative = Left, Some(0) = none,
// omitted/None = not applicable (towed guns not subject to breakdown).
